Sand Snake|Desert|Uncommon|serpent|0.8|D9B466|A07A32|FF3030|
Scorpion|Desert|Uncommon|scorp|0.9|2B2B33|4A3A2A|FF5030|
Camel|Desert|Rare|quad|1.8|C99A5E|E0BE86|7A5530|humps,longleg,slim,tailshort
Coyote|Desert|Rare|quad|1.0|A9865A|D8C09A|4A3A24|ears,longtail,slim
Ostrich|Desert|Epic|bird|1.5|2B2B2B|F2F2F2|E8A090|ostrich
Sand Golem|Desert|Epic|biped|2.3|C9A25E|8F6B34|FFB020|golem,rock
Dune Shark|Desert|Legendary|fish|1.8|C9A25E|F4E6C4|7A5A2A|
Sand Serpent|Desert|Legendary|serpent|1.8|D4A93E|7A4A18|FFD060|hood,spikes
Pharaoh Beast|Desert|Mythic|quad|2.0|2E3A8A|F2D060|FFD24A|stripes,headdress,ears
Sphinx|Desert|Mythic|quad|2.3|E0BE70|F2D890|FFD24A|bulky,headdress,wings
Golden Anubis|Desert|Divine|quad|2.4|1C1C24|FFD24A|FFE680|longleg,slim,bigears,anubis,glowcracks
Snow Rabbit|Snow|Common|quad|0.7|FFFFFF|E8F4FF|BFE6FF|longears,tailshort,round
Arctic Fox|Snow|Uncommon|quad|0.9|F4FAFF|FFFFFF|9AB8D0|ears,foxtail,slim
Snow Leopard|Snow|Rare|quad|1.3|DCE6F0|FFFFFF|40464F|ears,spots,longtail
Polar Bear|Snow|Rare|quad|1.7|F2F6FA|FFFFFF|9AA6B4|bulky,shortleg,tailshort,round
Snow Wolf|Snow|Rare|quad|1.1|E4EEF8|FFFFFF|7A8EA4|ears,longtail
Ice Penguin|Snow|Epic|biped|1.0|1E2430|FFFFFF|FF9A2E|penguin
Frost Bear|Snow|Epic|quad|1.8|A8E0FF|DDF4FF|5AB8F0|bulky,shortleg,tailshort,ice
Yeti|Snow|Legendary|biped|2.4|F4F8FF|8ED0FF|BFE8FF|yeti
Ice Dragon|Snow|Mythic|quad|2.2|5AB8FF|C8F0FF|2E8AE0|wings,horns,spikes,longtail,ice,glowcracks
Frost Giant|Snow|Mythic|biped|3.0|7CC8FF|DDF4FF|2E9AFF|golem,ice,glowcracks
Glacier Phoenix|Snow|Mythic|bird|2.0|8ED8FF|FFFFFF|2EC8FF|phoenix,ice
Frost Titan|Snow|Divine|biped|3.8|9AE8FF|E8FBFF|22D8FF|titan,ice,glowcracks
